  "summary": "The released 1.1.0 HELIO portable app includes per-load service review: inspect requested and delivered energy, grouped shortfalls with censored boundaries, and deliberately shed science demand separately.",
  "rationale": "The C++ numerical model and independent Python energy/reference checks remain intact. The actual extracted UI is tested against an independent 6 W minus 3.2 W over 600 seconds energy calculation, component-to-total reconciliation and an exact JSON download. Product-version identity and preserved native notices make the practical analysis available in a reviewable portable bundle.",
  "limitations": [
    "Fictional single-body/battery model; numerical agreement and balanced energy do not validate real batteries or establish spacecraft safety.",
    "No live hardware, power control or operational thermal assurance.",
    "Unsigned desktop portable folders, not system installers or clean-machine proof. Three-OS extracted-native checks drive an owned URL; default OS browser opening remains manual."
  ],
